# Copied to .env by `npm run db:setup` if .env does not exist. Never commit .env.
# SQLite file, relative to the repository root.
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"

# The demo's stand-ins: persona picker, time travel (?asOf= and the demo bar), Reset demo.
# On unless "off". A real deployment sets DEMO_MODE=off: "today" is then always the real date
# and nobody is signed in until a real login fills in src/server/current-user.ts.
# DEMO_MODE="off"
